OL,3,GNEWSADay centre for disabled adults in
OL,4,ABrighton to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last council-run day centre for
OL,7,Fadults with learning disabilities and
OL,8,Fautism in Brighton and Hove is to
OL,9,Fclose.
OL,11,FWellington House currently offers care
OL,12,Fto 21 people but will be shut to save
OL,13,F#336,000 a year, despite strong
OL,14,Fopposition.
OL,16,FCouncil leaders said users would be
OL,17,Ftransitioned to other services of equal
OL,18,For better quality in the city.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
