OL,3,GNEWSADay centre for disabled adults in
OL,4,ABrighton to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut relatives and carers said
OL,7,FWellington House offered a unique
OL,8,Fservice and the move would be
OL,9,F"devastating" for the vulnerable adults
OL,10,Fwith complex needs.
